    "1": "[.tooling/iac/terraform/deployments/aws/development/deploy-rag/README.md#deployment---deploy-common]\n\n# Deployment - Deploy Common\n\nBack to [Project](../../../../../../README.md) | [IAC](../../../../../README.md) | [Terraform](../../../../README.md) | [Deployments](../../../README.md) | [AWS](../../README.md) | [Environment](../README.md)",
    "2": "[.tooling/iac/terraform/deployments/aws/development/deploy-rag/README.md#description]\n\n## Description\n\nThis deployment is responsible for provisioning all product common shared resources. Shared resources are either multi-tenant SaaS specific or common resources shared across multiple tenant deployments.",
    "3": "[.tooling/iac/terraform/deployments/aws/development/deploy-rag/README.md#formations]\n\n## Formations\n\n|Name|Version|\n|----|-------|\n|[deploy-common](https://github.com/mygainwell/pfe-iac-modules/tree/main/terraform/formations/aws/deploy-common/README.md)|v1.3.3|",
    "4": "[.tooling/iac/terraform/deployments/aws/development/deploy-rag/README.md#example-use]\n\n## Example Use\n\nOpen a VSCode terminal and navigate to terragrunt.hcl file folder. The following commands are available:\n\n``` text\nterragrunt init\nterragrunt plan\nterragrunt apply\nterragrunt destroy\n```",
    "5": "[.tooling/iac/terraform/deployments/aws/development/deploy-rag/README.md#dependent-deployments]\n\n## Dependent Deployments\n\n- [Acquire State](../acquire-tfstate/README.md)",
    "6": "[.tooling/iac/terraform/deployments/aws/development/deploy-rag/README.md#state]\n\n## State\n\nThis formation will persist IaC state in the account-level state bucket created by the [Platform Gainwell onboard-product deployment](https://github.com/mygainwell/pfe-pg/tree/main/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/deployments/aws/development/onboard-products/pfe-example)."
